{"excerpt_id":"ex_33402410a906_018","source_id":"src_33402410a906","source_hash":"7d871f7fbe6afb5f06c170471aa65e595dc83f8d2828972f573107348be0b08c","text":"{\n\"Account\" : \"rrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrhoLvTp\" ,\n\"Amendment\" : \"42426C4D4F1009EE67080A9B7965B44656D7714D104A72F9B4369F97ABF044EE\" ,\n\"Fee\" : \"0\" ,\n\"LedgerSequence\" : 21225473 ,\n\"Sequence\" : 0 ,\n\"SigningPubKey\" : \"\" ,\n\"TransactionType\" : \"EnableAmendment\"\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 96","char_start":2444,"char_end":2696,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:38.125Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_33402410a906_019","source_id":"src_33402410a906","source_hash":"7d871f7fbe6afb5f06c170471aa65e595dc83f8d2828972f573107348be0b08c","text":"In addition to the common fields , EnableAmendment pseudo-transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 98","char_start":2722,"char_end":2818,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:38.125Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_33402410a906_020","source_id":"src_33402410a906","source_hash":"7d871f7fbe6afb5f06c170471aa65e595dc83f8d2828972f573107348be0b08c","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Description","location_hint":"paragraph 99","char_start":2822,"char_end":2863,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:38.125Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_33402410a906_021","source_id":"src_33402410a906","source_hash":"7d871f7fbe6afb5f06c170471aa65e595dc83f8d2828972f573107348be0b08c","text":"Amendment String UInt256 A unique identifier for the amendment. This is not intended to be a human-readable name. See Known Amendments for a list of known amendments.","location_hint":"paragraph 100","char_start":2867,"char_end":3033,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:38.125Z"}
